### MaterialSales — VOID (logical delete): status inactive and quantity returned to the lot (expects 200 OK)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/material-sales/{{id}}/deactivate

### MaterialSales — re-activate a voided sale (expects 200 OK; 409 if the lot no longer has the stock)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/material-sales/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}
